r/data/1773383/000177338325000154/0001773383-25-000154-index.htm","accession":"0001773383-25-000154"},{"text":"Net cash of $1.2bn against total assets of $4.4bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1773383/000177338326000019/0001773383-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001773383-26-000019"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-0.1% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1773383/000177338326000008/0001773383-26-000008-index.htm","accession":"0001773383-26-000008"}],"bear":[{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.2% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1773383/000214795526000004/0002147955-26-000004-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 73.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.73,"consecutive":2,"current":0.814,"current_display":"81.4%","threshold_display":"73.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 3.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.03,"consecutive":2,"current":0.182,"current_display":"18.2%","threshold_display":"3.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company 